"note": "@kharade @tien-thinh.nguyen \n\nMaybe one way to reproduce it is manipulate one docker-compose (like basic).\n\nDeploy first `mysql` and `oai-nrf`. Remove all the dependencies between the others NFs and deploy them.\nThey should try to register in parallel.\n\nRaphael",
"note_html": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:28\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"/kharade\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"3210\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Rohan\">@kharade</a> <a href=\"/tien-thinh.nguyen\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"409\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Tien-Thinh Nguyen\">@tien-thinh.nguyen</a></p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:76\" dir=\"auto\">Maybe one way to reproduce it is manipulate one docker-compose (like basic).</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:40\" dir=\"auto\">Deploy first <code data-sourcepos=\"5:15-5:19\">mysql</code> and <code data-sourcepos=\"5:27-5:33\">oai-nrf</code>. Remove all the dependencies between the others NFs and deploy them.\nThey should try to register in parallel.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:7\" dir=\"auto\">Raphael</p>",
"body_first_line_html": "<p><a href=\"/kharade\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"3210\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Rohan\">@kharade</a> <a href=\"/tien-thinh.nguyen\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"409\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Tien-Thinh Nguyen\">@tien-thinh.nguyen</a>...</p>",
