"note": "@defosseu <br/>\nLooks like issue coming from boost thread function `handle_heartbeat`, but shared pointer for nrf profile is unique per NF.\n```bash\n      boost::bind(\n          &nrf_profile::handle_heartbeat_timeout_nfregistration, this, _1)\n```\nAlso I am trying to replicate this issue as per above config settings you mentioned and do not get this issue.",
"note_html": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-2:123\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"/defosseu\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"2228\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Raphael Defosseux\">@defosseu</a> <br>\nLooks like issue coming from boost thread function <code data-sourcepos=\"2:53-2:68\">handle_heartbeat</code>, but shared pointer for nrf profile is unique per NF.</p>\n<div class=\"gl-relative markdown-code-block js-markdown-code\">\n<pre data-sourcepos=\"3:1-6:3\" data-canonical-lang=\"bash\" class=\"code highlight js-syntax-highlight language-shell\" lang=\"shell\" v-pre=\"true\"><code><span id=\"LC1\" class=\"line\" lang=\"shell\">      boost::bind<span class=\"o\">(</span></span>\n<span id=\"LC2\" class=\"line\" lang=\"shell\">          &amp;nrf_profile::handle_heartbeat_timeout_nfregistration, this, _1<span class=\"o\">)</span></span></code></pre>\n<copy-code></copy-code>\n</div>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:110\" dir=\"auto\">Also I am trying to replicate this issue as per above config settings you mentioned and do not get this issue.</p>",
"body_first_line_html": "<p><a href=\"/defosseu\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"2228\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" title=\"Raphael Defosseux\">@defosseu</a> \nLooks like issue coming from boost thread function <code>handle_heartbeat</code>, but shared pointer for nrf profile is uniq...</p>",
